# Row I6.1, consent records on the profile: who is refused the candidate's consents.
# The recruiter reads the answers, the opening's hiring manager reads that a notice was given; an interviewer, a hiring
# manager of another opening, a person with no grant, no session and the candidate's own guest cookie are refused
# (the tenant gate answers 403 before the route for the last three, H0).
GET /api/interviews/candidates/{candidates.kwame}/consents | interviewer interviewer2 workOnly=403 anon=403 guest=403 | recruiter hiringManager
GET /api/interviews/candidates/{candidates.ravi}/consents  | hiringManager interviewer | recruiter
